ink: 2.5
title: Pennant
text: Fly the pennant from the top of the pole, and make the pole above it white. The prism keeps only what it can use; nothing may spill out behind it.
trick: prism backwards: three white beams enter from three sides; the prism keeps blue itself, but red and green must be filtered first or the leftovers spill south-west
motif: pennant on a pole
expect: recolours>=2, black>=1
